      "duration_ms": 2515,
      "latency_ms": 2889,
      "retrieval_top_score": 0.0,
      "retrieved_chunk_ids": [
        "5127f2c3-d8c1-5497-a939-24a8cd52d863",
        "e6f8978e-01eb-5700-ba1b-cd966468b3e1",
        "f78129a5-33a8-505b-8c22-7916e57a8997",
        "7d059411-5848-52c0-8f3a-4c308c994fe2",
        "6f1b3bea-66f0-5d61-8793-5bdffa2e389c"
      ],
      "recall_at_5": 1.0,
      "mrr_at_5": 0.2,
      "citation_id_valid": true,
      "citation_count": 2,
      "tool_calls": [],
      "final_text_head": "Exit Code 137 通常表示容器因内存超限被内核 OOM Killer 终止，即 OOMKilled[1]；也可能是进程主动收到 SIGKILL 信号而退出[5]。在 Kubernetes 中，绝大多数情况下对应 `resources.limits.memory` 被突破，触发内核强制杀进程[1]。",
      "error": null,
      "multiturn_ab": null
    },
    {
      "qid": "q003",
      "category": "kb_qa",
      "question": "readinessProbe 失败会导致容器重启吗？",
      "should_answer": true,
      "expected_answer_type": "answered",
      "got_answer_type": "answered",
      "route": "kb_qa",
      "node_path": [
        "router",
        "retrieval",
        "evidence",
        "final"
      ],
      "duration_ms": 3029,
      "latency_ms": 3438,
      "retrieval_top_score": 0.0,
      "retrieved_chunk_ids": [
        "5127f2c3-d8c1-5497-a939-24a8cd52d863",
        "6f1b3bea-66f0-5d61-8793-5bdffa2e389c",
        "e6f8978e-01eb-5700-ba1b-cd966468b3e1",
        "7d059411-5848-52c0-8f3a-4c308c994fe2",
        "7c78dbb7-cc8c-5f78-af46-22d35fedcef3"
      ],
      "recall_at_5": 1.0,
      "mrr_at_5": 1.0,
      "citation_id_valid": true,
      "citation_count": 1,
      "tool_calls": [],
      "final_text_head": "不会。readinessProbe 失败只会把 Pod 从 Service 的端点（Endpoints）中摘除，使其不再接收流量，但**不会导致容器重启**[2]。  \n容器重启仅由 livenessProbe 失败触发[2]。",
      "error": null,
      "multiturn_ab": null
    },
    {
      "qid": "q004",
      "category": "kb_qa",
      "question": "启动很慢的应用应该用哪种探针保护？",
      "should_answer": true,
      "expected_answer_type": "answered",
      "got_answer_type": "answered",
      "route": "kb_qa",
      "node_path": [
        "router",
        "retrieval",
        "evidence",
        "final"
      ],
      "duration_ms": 2308,
      "latency_ms": 2671,
      "retrieval_top_score": 0.0,
      "retrieved_chunk_ids": [
        "2b1837e9-010d-59ab-86ed-66cd0428a852",
        "5127f2c3-d8c1-5497-a939-24a8cd52d863",
        "7d059411-5848-52c0-8f3a-4c308c994fe2",
        "f78129a5-33a8-505b-8c22-7916e57a8997",
        "e6f8978e-01eb-5700-ba1b-cd966468b3e1"
      ],
      "recall_at_5": 1.0,
      "mrr_at_5": 0.5,
      "citation_id_valid": true,
      "citation_count": 1,
      "tool_calls": [],
      "final_text_head": "启动很慢的应用应使用 `startupProbe` 保护 `[2]`。  \n因为将耗时的启动检查放入 `livenessProbe` 会导致应用尚未启动完成就被反复重启；而 `startupProbe` 可专门用于覆盖启动慢的场景，避免过早触发重启 `[2]`。",
      "error": null,
      "multiturn_ab": null
    },
